/- # Lean4Commit0
   A Lean 4 port of the Commit0 benchmark for evaluating coding agents.

   Each library module contains type signatures with `sorry` placeholders.
   The agent's task is to implement all `sorry`s such that `lake build` succeeds.

   Original benchmark: https://github.com/commit-0/commit0
   Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.01769
-/
